   ],
   "reason": "the header of a whole block read without decoding its body's contents, for the node's ChainSync server, through the envelope and header code Block.decode and LeiosBlock.read use: the reference's ChainSync server reads a stored block's header bytes alone, at the offset and size its storage indexes keep (getBinaryBlockInfo, ouroboros-consensus Cardano/Node.hs getHfcBinaryBlockInfo; readHeader, ImmutableDB/Impl/Iterator.hs), which Scarab's immutable index does not keep"
  },
  {
   "definitions": [
    "object ledger.LeiosBlockBody"
   ],
   "reason": "the minimal CBOR writer of the header body encoders (shortest heads, definite lists), shared with the Leios block encoders; the reference's Encoding primitives (cardano-ledger-binary Encoding/Encoder.hs) have no single counterpart here"
  },
  {
   "definitions": [
    "class ledger.LeiosBlock.OutsideEra",
